# sdist contents (SPEC §18, docs/README.md: "All documents ship in the sdist").
# The wheel stays exactly one module; this file only affects the source dist.
# The sdist is also self-testing: the guard tests read the CI/release
# workflows and tests/wine_exec_bit_check.py, so they ship too.
include SPEC.md CHANGELOG.md AGENTS.md
recursive-include docs *.md
recursive-include research *.md
recursive-include tests *.py
graft .github
